				{
					"id": 411420101,
					"content": "我这就送过去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411420102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411420102,
					"content": "那就麻烦你了，实在帮大忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411420103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卯师傅"
				},
				{
					"id": 411420103,
					"content": "拿好了，就是这份珍珠翡翠白玉汤，送的时候记得当心点，<color=#00E1FFFF>别被撞翻了，也千万别用风之翼</color>，不然弄洒了都不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411420104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卯师傅"
				},
				{
					"id": 411420104,
					"content": "还有就是，<color=#00E1FFFF>别沾了奇怪的东西</color>。不然可能串了味道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411420105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卯师傅"
				},
				{
					"id": 411420105,
					"content": "好了，快点把这菜送过去吧，凉了就不好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卯师傅"
